      "message": "In `gr-diff-styles.ts`, `max-height: var(--image-viewer-max-height, 90vh);` is still defined on the base `gr-image-viewer` selector.\n\nWhen a user selects a fixed zoom level (e.g. 100%, 150%, 200%), the `.fit` class is removed from `gr-image-viewer`, but the base selector still applies and clamps the height to 90vh. Because light-DOM styles in `gr-diff-styles.ts` override shadow-DOM `:host` styles on the image viewer component, other zoom levels are not truly unconstrained.\n\nConsider removing `max-height` from `gr-image-viewer` here so that `max-height` is only constrained when `gr-image-viewer.fit` is active.",
